<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 69.3059 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 69.3059 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 69.3059 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.3592 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 25		  Sep 24</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.3059		 69.3592</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  3.245		   2.750</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46.23		   45.76</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.010		   0.030</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
